OL,3,GNEWSAPort of Aberdeen reports best-ever
OL,4,Acruise ship season
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Port of Aberdeen has reported its
OL,7,Fbest ever cruise ship season, with
OL,8,F54,000 people visiting the city.
OL,10,FThe number of tourists rose by 26%
OL,11,Fcompared with last year, with 71
OL,12,Fvessels arriving during 2026.
OL,14,FPort of Aberdeen chief executive Bob
OL,15,FSanguinetti said: "Cruise tourism is
OL,16,Fcreating an ocean of opportunity for
OL,17,FAberdeen and Aberdeenshire, bringing
OL,18,Fvisitors from around the world and
OL,19,Fsupporting local businesses."
OL,23,APub: 13-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
