OL,3,GNEWSAPort of Aberdeen reports best-ever
OL,4,Acruise ship season
OL,5,
OL,6,FVisitAberdeenshire said the influx of
OL,7,Ftourists brought additional footfall
OL,8,Fand spending in local attractions,
OL,9,Fshops and hospitality businesses across
OL,10,Fthe region.
